      "teamId": "study-team-05",
      "authorId": "agent",
      "content": "For the best lechon in Cebu, check out these spots:\n\n- **Cebu Lechon**: Famous for its crispy skin and flavorful meat.\n- **Lapu-Lapu City Lechon**: Known for its traditional preparation.\n- **Zubuchon**: Highly recommended for its unique flavors and quality.\n\nEnjoy your trip and the lechon!",
