      "teamId": "study-team-05",
      "authorId": "agent",
      "content": "Here are some great holiday destinations for graduating students:\n\n- **Bali, Indonesia**: Affordable, beautiful beaches, and vibrant nightlife.\n- **Barcelona, Spain**: Rich culture, amazing food, and plenty of activities.\n- **Tokyo, Japan**: Unique blend of tradition and modernity with lots to explore.\n- **Cancun, Mexico**: Great for relaxation, parties, and beautiful resorts.\n\nThese spots offer a mix of fun, adventure, and relaxation!",
