    {
      "id": "ab1a5e77-4973-4e3d-9d07-170e826e69ad",
      "teamId": "study-team-05",
      "authorId": "agent",
      "content": "Here’s a 5-day plan for your trip to Cebu:\n\n**Day 1: Arrival & Relaxation**\n- Arrive in Cebu.\n- Check into your accommodation.\n- Explore nearby beaches or relax by the hotel pool.\n\n**Day 2: City Tour**\n- Visit Magellan's Cross and Basilica del Santo Niño.\n- Explore Fort San Pedro.\n- Enjoy local food at a traditional restaurant.\n\n**Day 3: Water Adventures**\n- Go island hopping to nearby islands (like Mactan or Malapascua).\n- Snorkeling or diving activities.\n- Enjoy a beach BBQ dinner.\n\n**Day 4: Nature & Adventure**\n- Visit Kawasan Falls for canyoneering or a swim.\n- Explore Osmeña Peak for hiking and stunning views.\n- Return to the city for dinner.\n\n**Day 5: Cultural Experience & Departure**\n- Visit Taboan Public Market for local snacks and souvenirs.\n- Try lechon at a famous spot.\n- Head to the airport for departure.\n\nEnjoy your trip!",
      "contentType": "text",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-25T08:36:20.901Z",
      "metadata": {
        "parentMessageId": "93d7eb61-84f3-4160-95a6-d656a8c00b09",
        "classification": {
          "intent": "none",
          "sentiment": "neutral",
          "urgency": "low",
          "topics": [
