    {
      "id": "0ef8c9bc-3bfb-4979-9963-0040aa043438",
      "teamId": "study-team-05",
      "authorId": "agent",
      "content": "Here’s a nature-focused 5-day plan for Cebu, including hotel suggestions:\n\n**Day 1: Arrival & Beach Relaxation**\n- Arrive in Cebu.\n- Check into **Shangri-La's Mactan Resort & Spa** or **Crimson Resort & Spa**.\n- Relax at the beach or pool.\n\n**Day 2: Island Hopping**\n- Go island hopping to **Bantayan Island** or **Malapascua** for snorkeling.\n- Stay at **Bantayan Island Nature Park and Resort** or **Malapascua Exotic Island Dive & Beach Resort**.\n\n**Day 3: Waterfalls & Hiking**\n- Visit **Kawasan Falls** for canyoneering or swimming.\n- Check into **Badian Island Wellness Resort** for a night.\n- Hike **Osmeña Peak** for stunning views.\n\n**Day 4: Wildlife Experience**\n- Visit **Cebu Safari and Adventure Park**.\n- Stay at **Eagle Point Beach and Dive Resort** for beautiful nature surroundings.\n\n**Day 5: Nature Trails & Departure**\n- Explore **Sirao Flower Farm** for picturesque landscapes.\n- Return to the city for departure.\n\nEnjoy the beautiful nature Cebu has to offer!",
      "contentType": "text",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-25T08:36:49.250Z",
      "metadata": {
        "parentMessageId": "f7ede623-3127-4990-91fe-579375d500d1",
