    {
      "id": "ba44660c-229f-4745-99d5-bfa291984351",
      "teamId": "study-team-05",
      "authorId": "agent",
      "content": "Costs can vary based on travel style, but here’s a rough estimate for a 5-day trip in Cebu for three people:\n\n- **Flights**: $300 - $600 per person (round trip).\n- **Accommodation**: $100 - $300 per night for mid-range hotels (total around $500 - $1,500).\n- **Food**: $20 - $50 per person per day (total around $300 - $750).\n- **Activities**: $50 - $150 per person for tours and adventures (total around $300 - $900).\n\nOverall, you might be looking at approximately **$2,000 - $4,800** for the entire trip. Adjust based on your preferences and budget!",
      "contentType": "text",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-25T08:36:57.410Z",
      "metadata": {
        "parentMessageId": "430a06a8-0829-4b9a-ab73-a4c5f5b4e352",
