    {
      "id": "9667f0ba-c87e-4da1-a93e-14ceb4342262",
      "teamId": "study-team-05",
      "authorId": "agent",
      "content": "Here are some must-try dishes in Cebu:\n\n- **Lechon**: Cebu's famous roasted pig, known for its crispy skin.\n- **Sutukil**: A combination of grilled seafood, usually served with dipping sauces.\n- **Pancit Canton**: Stir-fried noodles with vegetables and meat.\n- **Kinilaw**: A ceviche-style dish made with fresh fish marinated in vinegar and spices.\n- **Chorizo de Cebu**: Local sausage that’s sweet and slightly spicy.\n\nEnjoy the delicious food while you're there!",
      "contentType": "text",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-25T08:40:02.194Z",
      "metadata": {
        "parentMessageId": "2b08c6fe-23e5-4e86-8945-e4a3e5d9fe25",
        "classification": {
          "intent": "casual_chat",
