      "id": "f67bf468-aae5-42a4-80ca-86715a88793b",
      "teamId": "study-team-05",
      "authorId": "agent",
      "content": "Got it! Here’s a 2-day weekend trip plan for Cebu:\n\n**Day 1: Arrival & City Tour**\n- Arrive in Cebu in the morning.\n- Visit **Magellan's Cross** and **Basilica del Santo Niño**.\n- Lunch at a local restaurant for **Lechon**.\n- Explore **Fort San Pedro** and **Taoist Temple**.\n- Dinner at **Lantaw Native Restaurant** for great views.\n\n**Day 2: Beach & Adventure**\n- Morning trip to **Mactan Island** for water activities (snorkeling or island hopping).\n- Lunch at a beachfront restaurant.\n- Relax at the beach or pool.\n- Depart in the evening.\n\nThis plan keeps it fun and relaxed! Let me know if you need any adjustments!",
      "contentType": "text",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-25T08:40:22.813Z",
