      "id": "7ee93845-6fba-4af0-878b-9b5b71923b54",
      "teamId": "study-team-05",
      "authorId": "agent",
      "content": "For a cheap weekend trip outside Singapore, consider these options:\n\n- **Batam, Indonesia**: Just a short ferry ride away, you can enjoy affordable resorts, shopping, and local cuisine.\n- **Bintan, Indonesia**: Offers beautiful beaches and water activities, with budget-friendly accommodations.\n- **Johor Bahru, Malaysia**: Close to the border, it has shopping malls, water parks, and great food options.\n\nThese destinations are easy to reach and perfect for a fun getaway!",
      "contentType": "text",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-25T08:42:00.542Z",
