      "id": "84756a0f-c65f-4808-9fa1-20e4b38498dd",
      "teamId": "study-team-05",
      "authorId": "agent",
      "content": "Here are some fun things to do in Johor Bahru (JB):\n\n- **Visit Legoland Malaysia**: A great theme park for thrill-seekers and families.\n- **Shopping at Johor Premium Outlets**: Find great deals on brands.\n- **Explore the Austin Heights Water & Adventure Park**: Perfect for a day of fun.\n- **Check out the local food scene**: Try famous dishes like **Nasi Lemak** and **Laksa**.\n- **Visit the Sultan Abu Bakar State Mosque**: A beautiful architectural site.\n\nThere's plenty to enjoy in JB!",
      "contentType": "text",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-25T08:42:33.312Z",
      "metadata": {
        "parentMessageId": "d5525280-ed4b-4c7e-adea-71b96ecdcfa0",
        "classification": {
          "intent": "casual_chat",
          "sentiment": "positive",
