    {
      "id": "f9311030-7c64-44c4-90ea-aea3e0b92eb7",
      "teamId": "study-team-05",
      "authorId": "agent",
      "content": "For a 2-day trip to Johor Bahru (JB), here’s a quick itinerary:\n\n**Day 1: Arrival & Exploration**\n- Arrive in JB and check into your hotel.\n- Visit **Legoland Malaysia** or **Hello Kitty Town** for fun attractions.\n- Lunch at **KSL City Mall** or local eateries.\n- Explore **JB City Square** for shopping and snacks.\n- Dinner at a local restaurant, like **Restoran ZZ Sup Tulang**.\n\n**Day 2: Relax & Adventure**\n- Morning visit to **Puteri Harbour** for scenic views.\n- Try the **JB Night Safari** in the evening for a unique experience.\n- Enjoy some local street food before heading back.\n\nThis plan mixes fun, relaxation, and adventure! Let me know if you need more details!",
      "contentType": "text",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-25T08:42:36.889Z",
      "metadata": {
        "parentMessageId": "9bb273af-1124-407b-a39c-7d84aff3febf",
