    {
      "id": "fdd6084f-beba-482d-8dfa-04db7f0dba8e",
      "teamId": "study-team-05",
      "authorId": "agent",
      "content": "Here’s a 2-day plan for your trip to Johor Bahru, including food, nightlife, and hotel suggestions:\n\n### Day 1: Arrival & Fun\n- **Morning**: \n  - Arrive in JB and check into **Hotel Jen Puteri Harbour** or **M Suites Hotel**.\n- **Lunch**: \n  - Try **Restoran ZZ Sup Tulang** for local dishes.\n- **Afternoon**: \n  - Visit **Legoland Malaysia** for exciting rides.\n- **Evening**: \n  - Dinner at **The Replacement - Lodge & Kitchen** for a cozy vibe.\n- **Nightlife**: \n  - Head to **Brewland** or **Luna Sky Bar** for drinks and a great view.\n\n### Day 2: Adventure & Relaxation\n- **Morning**: \n  - Breakfast at your hotel or **Old Town White Coffee**.\n- **Late Morning**: \n  - Explore **Puteri Harbour** and enjoy the waterfront.\n- **Lunch**: \n  - Visit **KSL City Mall** and grab a meal at **Sushi King**.\n- **Afternoon**: \n  - Relax at **Austin Heights Water & Adventure Park**.\n- **Dinner**: \n  - Enjoy local street food at **Jalan Dhoby**.\n- **Nightlife**: \n  - Chill at **The Bierhaus** for a laid-back atmosphere.\n\nThis plan gives you a mix of fun activities, great food, and nightlife options! Enjoy your trip!",
      "contentType": "text",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-25T08:43:04.639Z",
