      "authorId": "agent",
      "content": "Here are ten popular Chinese names you might consider for your child:\n\n1. Wei (伟) - Great\n2. Jing (静) - Quiet\n3. Ming (明) - Bright\n4. Yan (燕) - Swallow (the bird)\n5. Ying (英) - Heroic\n6. Li (丽) - Beautiful\n7. Feng (风) - Wind\n8. Tao (涛) - Waves\n9. Hua (华) - Flower\n10. Jun (俊) - Talented\n\nFeel free to mix and match or look for variations that resonate with you!",
