      "teamId": "study-team-05",
      "authorId": "agent",
      "content": "Here are some signs a girl might like you, even if she's sending mixed signals:\n\n1. **Engagement**: She initiates conversations or asks you questions about yourself.\n2. **Body Language**: Look for positive body language, like leaning in, maintaining eye contact, or smiling.\n3. **Time Together**: She makes an effort to spend time with you or includes you in her plans.\n4. **Teasing or Flirting**: Light teasing or playful banter can be a sign of interest.\n\nIf you're unsure, consider discussing your feelings directly with her for clarity!",
