      "id": "d45441d5-68f4-4470-8909-7761216a40c6",
      "teamId": "study-team-05",
      "authorId": "agent",
      "content": "To figure out if you like men, consider these steps:\n\n1. **Reflect on Your Feelings**: Think about your emotional and physical attractions. Do you find yourself drawn to men in a romantic or sexual way?\n2. **Consider Past Experiences**: Think about any past interactions or crushes you may have had. Did you feel excited or nervous around men?\n3. **Explore Your Thoughts**: Pay attention to your thoughts about men. Are you curious about dating or being intimate with them?\n4. **Talk to Someone**: If you're comfortable, discussing your feelings with a friend or counselor can help you gain clarity.\n\nRemember, it's okay to take your time figuring this out!",
      "contentType": "text",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-25T08:51:14.534Z",
