      "teamId": "study-team-05",
      "authorId": "agent",
      "content": "To know if you like men, consider the following:\n\n1. **Attraction**: Pay attention to whether you feel attracted to men emotionally or physically.\n2. **Feelings**: Reflect on any crushes or strong feelings you've had towards men.\n3. **Interests**: Think about whether you enjoy spending time with men or feel drawn to them in a romantic way.\n\nIt’s totally okay to explore your feelings at your own pace!",
