    {
      "id": "b7abc86e-f122-497a-b01e-c0012acd5238",
      "teamId": "study-team-05",
      "authorId": "agent",
      "content": "To learn how to Dougie, follow these simple steps:\n\n1. **Start with the basics**: Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart.\n2. **Body Movement**: Shift your weight from one foot to the other while bending your knees slightly.\n3. **Arm Movement**: Move your arms side to side, alternating as you shift your weight. You can keep one arm bent and the other straight.\n4. **Add some flair**: Incorporate some head nods and shoulder movements to give it more style.\n5. **Practice**: Put on a song with a good beat and practice the steps until you feel comfortable!\n\nHave fun with it!",
      "contentType": "text",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-25T08:52:22.722Z",
      "metadata": {
        "parentMessageId": "e7e7f884-d743-4327-8023-3163bf14da99",
        "classification": {
