    {
      "id": "3b8959a4-38cc-4c5d-88b1-ff2597819d7a",
      "teamId": "study-team-05",
      "authorId": "agent",
      "content": "To kiss a guy, follow these steps:\n\n1. **Get Close**: Find a comfortable moment to get closer to him, making sure you're both relaxed.\n2. **Make Eye Contact**: Lock eyes and smile to create a connection.\n3. **Lean In**: Tilt your head slightly to one side and lean in gently.\n4. **Start Softly**: Press your lips against his softly and gauge his reaction.\n5. **Follow His Lead**: If he responds positively, you can deepen the kiss or explore different techniques.\n\nRemember to keep it natural and enjoy the moment!",
      "contentType": "text",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-25T08:52:30.655Z",
      "metadata": {
        "parentMessageId": "7cb43949-dcc4-4c8d-af39-9036021c7ecc",
