    {
      "id": "a592798b-6231-4eeb-9f9c-58621f6ef42a",
      "teamId": "study-team-05",
      "authorId": "agent",
      "content": "Kissing someone significantly taller can be a bit tricky, but here are some tips:\n\n1. **Stand on Your Toes**: If you're comfortable, rise up on your toes to bridge the height gap.\n2. **Find a Comfortable Angle**: Tilt your head slightly to the side to make it easier to reach his lips.\n3. **Use Your Hands**: Gently pull him down by the shoulders or wrap your arms around his neck to bring him closer.\n4. **Create the Moment**: Choose a moment where you can both lean in, such as during a hug or while he’s sitting down.\n\nKeep it relaxed and natural; it’s all about the connection!",
      "contentType": "text",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-25T08:52:47.746Z",
      "metadata": {
        "parentMessageId": "82ec95fa-0f01-48fe-b06a-65ef474cb9db"
